{"id":"1493c9672f397c1c","group":"16","path":"16/16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary.md","title":"任意重索引条件的反例","display":"ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary — 任意重索引条件的反例","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary","display":"ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary — 任意重索引条件的反例","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Explicit counterexample to the former local formula; based on Definition 3.4.1 and Example 3.4.4(ii)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary","16-ex--equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary — 任意重索引条件的反例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Explicit counterexample to the former local formula; based on Definition 3.4.1 and Example 3.4.4(ii)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary</span><span>16-ex--equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>，使用其规范分裂。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(I=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{*\\}\">\\(J=\\{*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 是唯一函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_A(X)\">\\(\\mathsf S_A(X)\\)</span> 是下文给出的子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq A\">\\(X\\subseteq A\\)</span> 到真实纤维对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,[\\iota_X])\">\\((A,[\\iota_X])\\)</span> 的编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X\">\\(\\iota_X\\)</span> 使用 Set 的带源靶标签箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_A=\\mathsf S_A(A)\">\\(\\top_A=\\mathsf S_A(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_A\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_A\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a> 的无参数等式函子，取子对象纤维中沿对角的左伴随；它的对象作用在下文通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S\">\\(\\mathsf S\\)</span> 明确给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_X^A&amp;\\coloneqq(X,A,\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_A(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(A,[\\iota_X^A]),\\\\\n\\top_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_A(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(\\mathsf S_A(X))&amp;=\\mathsf S_{A\\times A}(\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&amp;=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(I\\times I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J)&amp;=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&amp;\\ne\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_X^A&amp;\\coloneqq(X,A,\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_A(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(A,[\\iota_X^A]),\\\\\n\\top_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_A(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(\\mathsf S_A(X))&amp;=\\mathsf S_{A\\times A}(\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&amp;=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(I\\times I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J)&amp;=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&amp;\\ne\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子对象纤维的对象是带基对象标签的单态射同构类，不是裸子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_A\">\\(\\mathsf S_A\\)</span> 保留这个编码；不同子集的包含单态射不可能在切片中同构，故右侧两个对象不同。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的对角是整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\times J\">\\(J\\times J\\)</span>，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\times u\">\\(u\\times u\\)</span> 拉回给整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times I\">\\(I\\times I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的相等只含对角点。因此任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的相等换基式不成立，反例内容与参数换基条件保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.4.1 与 Example 3.4.4(ii) 的集合子对象实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-set]] 的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 及 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]] 的 $p=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$，使用其规范分裂。$I=\\{0,1\\}$、$J=\\{*\\}$，$u:I\\to J$ 是唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-set]] 的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 及 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]] 的 $p=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$，使用其规范分裂。$I=\\{0,1\\}$、$J=\\{*\\}$，$u:I\\to J$ 是唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Eq}_A$ 为 [[16-df-eq-functor]] 的无参数等式函子，取子对象纤维中沿对角的左伴随；它的对象作用在下文通过 $\\mathsf S$ 明确给出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"p=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_A(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"(A,[\\iota_X])","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_A=\\mathsf S_A(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_X^A&\\coloneqq(X,A,\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_A(X)&\\coloneqq(A,[\\iota_X^A]),\\\\\n\\top_A&\\coloneqq\\mathsf S_A(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(\\mathsf S_A(X))&=\\mathsf S_{A\\times A}(\\{(x,x)\\mid x\\in X\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(I\\times I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J)&=\\mathsf S_{I\\times I}(\\{(0,0),(1,1)\\}),\\\\\n(u\\times u)^*\\mathsf{Eq}_J(\\top_J)&\\ne\\mathsf{Eq}_I(u^*\\top_J).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_A","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"u\\times u","display":false},{"tex":"I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":2268,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-384","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary|ex-equality-reindexing-not-arbitrary — 任意重索引条件的反例]]"}],"outgoing":["d70ce677a3070a45","6c23c06c4d297e8d","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}